//! Sounio semantic authority for Pireus Operator-Lowering Forge v6.
//!
//! The matcher-free source was committed before the first Sounio transcript.
//! The exact matcher at the end of this file was appended only after that
//! transcript was committed. The generation path still accepts no injected
//! candidate count, quotient count, selected program, target result, cost, or
//! performance value.

